text.en:
The following offences may be compounded by the Authority in accordance with section 71 —

(a) an offence under section 10(3), 11(6), 12(4) or (5), 13(10)(b) or (11), 14(7) or (9), 15(5), (6), (8) or (9), 17(2) or (3), 24(2), 31(5), 40(6), (9), (10) or (11), 43(3) or 57(3), other than a continuing offence under section 10(3), 11(6), 13(10)(b), 15(6) or (9), 24(2), 31(5), 40(6) or (10), 43(3) or 57(3);

(b) an offence under regulation 29, 30, 32(1), 33(1), (2), (3), (4), (5) or (6), 34(1), (2), (3) or (4), 35, 36, 37, 38, 39(1) or (2), 41, 42A, 47(3), 48(4), 49(4), 50(2), 57 or 59 of the Building Control Regulations (Rg 1);

(c) an offence under regulation 3(3), 5(3), 6(6), 7(3), 8 or 11(2) of the Building Control (Temporary Buildings) Regulations (Rg 2); and

(d) an offence under regulation 12 of the Building Control (Advertisement, Billboard and Signboard) Regulations (Rg 3).
